    "\"level\" 0: c n quad \"level\" 1: 2 dot c n/2 = c n quad \"level\" 2: 4 dot c n/4 = c n",
    "\"levels: \" log_2 n + 1 quad \"each costs \" c n",
    "T(n) = c n (log_2 n + 1) = Theta(n log n)",
